    pile solitaireFreecellPile2 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(52)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile3 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(52)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile4 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(52)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile5 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(52)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile6 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(52)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile7 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(52)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile8 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(52)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile9 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(52)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile10 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(13)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile11 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(13)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile12 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(13)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile13 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(13)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile14 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(1)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile15 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(1)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile16 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(1)

    pile solitaireFreecellPile17 of solitaireFreecellCards capacity(1)

    table solitaireFreecell: Int capacity(27) {
      request = 0
      applied = 0
      action = 0
